>1. So the 64K questions is, what should you wish for? Keep in mind
>that the deepest I have ever gone is dlevel 9, exp 9 ONCE, so I'd like
>something that helps me go deeper NOW, as oppossed to something that
>would enable me to win the game if I lived long enough.
