I usually search for a ring of conflict and if I don't find one I sometimes
wish for one.  It's great on the castle level.  Another item, that is sometimes
hard to come by is a shield of reflection.  Also very useful when you want to
ward off missile attacks and things like floating eye gazes.

I also think wisjing for a Stormbringer is a waste, since I got it with a 
mere 6 sacrifices (no luckstone).  It's best to get large corpse, like an
Ogre or so.

>
>3. Will #dipping stuff in holy water merely bless it (from cursed to
>uncursed) or will it enchant it as well.

Yup, it will bring a uncursed item to a blessed item status.  Good for
scrolls of enchant armour.

>
>5. How do you convert "bad" potions to water/ holy water.

Try dropping them on a lawful alter.  That converts plain water to holy water.

